; Botched! map resource
; id: tarworks-01
; name: Tar Works
; description: G2-C playtest: one tar generator (A) in the middle; the eight tiles around it are tar.
; players: 2-4
;
; Tar slows voluntary movement and never hurts: a robot standing in tar cannot move with FORWARD_1 or BACK_1,
; FORWARD_2 moves it one tile, and a FORWARD_2 that carries it into tar stops there. Turning, DROP, TOGGLE and
; WAIT are normal, and pushes and belts ignore tar. The generator sits in the middle (columns 4-6, rows 3-5 are
; tar, except the generator itself) with dispenser G1 inside the area, so the central crate is a slow grab,
; while the outer ring is clear and fast. The walls give a corridor to each side of the tar.
